# bulk template-import commit that also added a CITATION.cff belonging to
# an unrelated project — with no recorded license-change decision. The
# project's own R code headers (app/annotater.R, app/app.R) say GPLv3, and
# the README badge and app footer have said GPLv3 since 2025-12-05.
# Neither declaration is clearly the deliberate project license; see
# docs/implementation-notes.md (release-prep housekeeping record) and
# docs/legacy.md. Do not add a value here without resolving that.
